&lt;li&gt;Define the vision, goals, strategy, tactics, and roadmap for our suite of products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Study, research, and understand the data ecosystem, with a specific focus on user requirements, market potential, and competitive landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the accountable owner for delivering measurable business and customer outcomes; working closely with designers to create intuitive, elegant user experiences for technical and non-technical personas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create tight feedback loops with customers who are depending on DataHub to run their data environments so that the product evolves toward the needs of these stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate ambiguous user problems into well-scoped product initiatives with clear definitions of success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute cross-functionally to launch new product experiences, improve existing features, test effectiveness of workflows, and facilitate GTM motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspire teams of people to achieve great things together, while also tying the roadmap within a domain to broader product strategy goals and company goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
