&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in product management or related function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience working on Products with PLG or self-serve growth motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply quantitative and enjoy rolling up your sleeves and exploring the data and connecting it to strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the data space, using or building data tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have an edge if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience working with the modern data stack (Fivetran, Snowflake, BigQuery, Redshift, Spark, dbt, Looker, PowerBI, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
